NOTE / 说明

This repository is a technical demo generated with the DeepSeek API.
It is NOT a commercial game: there is no distribution, monetisation,
account system, or online service. All art assets are procedurally
generated placeholders, and the text/code/screenshots are original work
of the author.

本仓库是使用 DeepSeek API 生成的技术演示，不是商业游戏：不发行、不运营、
无账号与联机服务。美术均为程序化占位，文案/代码/截图为本项目原创。
